      "description": "DOWNLOAD THE JD SPORTS APP TODAY \n\nThe JD Sports app puts the latest sportswear, streetwear and styles right at your fingertips. Shop the biggest brands, discover upcoming offers & arrivals, and stay in the loop with the top trending footwear, clothing & accessories. \n\nJD is the hub for all the freshest drops, iconic styles & exclusive looks from Nike, New Balance, adidas, ASICS, Jordan & PUMA. Whether you're shopping for everyday style, running shoes, training gear or accessories, the JD Sports app makes it easier to find what you're looking for & stay ahead of the latest trends. \n\nGet launch & restock alerts, track your orders, shop app-exclusive offers and find your nearest store, all on the JD app. Plus, get 10% off your first app order with code APPOFFER. \n\nBLACK FRIDAY AT JD \n\nOur huge Black Friday event features all your favourites in the sale. Shop unmissable offers on styles you love and bag savings like no other. And with the JD app, it's the best way to find the best Black Friday and Cyber Monday deals you want to shop. \n\nSHOP THE BIGGEST BRANDS \n\nNobody does it like JD. The latest Nike trainers, classic adidas sneakers, fresh New Balance running shoes and more. JD has got an unreal footwear lineup; with a stacked collection we’re not stopping there either, explore loads of JD-exclusive styles, too. \n\nFind products across clothing, footwear and accessories from the hottest sports & lifestyle brands. Discover exclusive heat, limited-edition launches and new season collections, all on the app. Including Nike trainers, running shoes & sportswear, adidas trainers, clothing & accessories, New Balance running & lifestyle footwear, iconic Jordan sneakers & apparel, and performance & gym gear from the likes of ASICS & On Running. \n\nTHE LATEST FOOTWEAR \n\nTrainers are what we do best. Explore iconic sneakers and new-season trainers for every occasion. From everyday essentials to statement styles, shop the latest Nike Air Max & Air Force 1, and adidas Samba, Gazelle & Spezial collections, alongside running shoes from the likes of On Running. \n\nFor those cosy winter days, you can find the Classic Clog from Crocs, elevated slip-ons from UGG and even more off-duty shoes on the JD app. Whether you're into running, training or casual streetwear style, discover footwear made for performance, comfort and everyday wear. \n\nFRESH FITS EVERY DAY \n\nUpdate your rotation with the latest fits for every season. Shop hoodies, T-shirts, tracksuits, joggers, jackets and more from your favourite brands. From everyday basics to standout streetwear, find clothing from some of the world’s biggest fashion names. Complete your winter wardrobe with matching fits, premium layers and casual essentials designed for both style & comfort. \n\nTRAINING, RUNNING & SPORTS \n\nTake your performance up a level with running, training and sports essentials built to support every workout. Whether you're heading to the gym, going for a run or getting set for yoga classes, shop performance footwear, technical clothing and accessories. \n\nFrom the stadium to the streets, support your team in the latest football kits, shirts and training wear. Shop football boots, training clothing, sportswear and equipment ready for match days & training sessions. \n\nEXCLUSIVE OFFERS & EARLY ACCESS \n\nStay one step ahead with the JD app. \n\nGet notified about the latest launches, restocks and exclusive offers. Be the first to know when the newest trainers & sneakers drop, and access app-exclusive promotions throughout the year. \n\nPAY YOUR WAY \n\nThe JD app puts you in control of payments. A fast, easy checkout – however you want it. Pay by card, PayPal, Apple Pay, or split the cost with Klarna. Get it delivered to your door or collect in-store. \n\nDOWNLOAD THE JD SPORTS APP TODAY \n\nShop the latest trainers, sportswear, streetwear and accessories from the brands you love. Discover new arrivals, unlock exclusive offers and stay ahead of every drop.",
